<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Projet Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="toc3">1Th</para>
  <para style="toc2">Watheti wa Thimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wa theti kwena Thimoti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wa theti kwena Thimoti</para>
  <para style="mt1">1THIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Khumbu ya Thimoti yisi tumbuka mbala za lawu mu mukanda wa Mihangu mya Bathumwa yi muna mikanda mya Pholu. Kikuma Thimoti, musindikidi wa Pholu kákala mu kisalu kya Nzambi. Kámusindikila muna bitumu byandi bya lawu. Bitumu bya phasi lawu bakala mutuma kwena Pholu, mu kingenga, ku Tesalonika yi kuna Khoditu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mikanda myodi bámuhitika Thimoti. Básonikamya, hana mipfundila mya lukwikilu lwa bakidisitu basikudimya kedi. Butadidini, buthwena, kusya mu ndonga mambu ma Mabundu yi kuzyamisa lukwikilu lwa mawu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda wa theti wubati hana ndongisila kwena bakidisitu, kwena bathwadisi ba kimvuka, yi kwena yandi-meni Thimoti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakidisitu ba lawu bisi longa yi bifu (1:3-7; 4:1-4; 6:3-5). Bisi banza ni bima bya tsi mbi byenina. Yi hakana bisi bwisila longu yi kudya madya mahika. Kinga, byosu bina káhanga Nzambi mboti byenina. Thimoti kafweti bambukisa mamana kwena bakidisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bimvuka bya bakidisitu bidiyidikini. Byenina yi bathwadisi. Babana benina bapfumu ba bimvuka; basadi bana bisi basadisa yi babana phi bisi sadisa baphutu, bambefu, bambuta ba mabundu babana bisi twadisa yi kulonga muna bimvuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bimvuka meni byabina byenina yi mupfunu wa kuzingila mu talala amana babatambwasa muna tsi yosu. Mubindudi wa mukanda kabati hana milongi mitadidi bisambu yi mutindu wa kusadila bisambu (khaphu ya 2). Kabati songila phi mutindu wuna fwani bazingila bathwadisi (khaphu ya 3).</para>
  <para style="ip">Thimoti kenina mwana bábuta kwena tata wa mungeleki yi ngudi wa mukidisitu wa kisina kya Bayuta. Pholu wámulonga amana kenina kikuma kya yandi hanga mwana. Hanga wukituki mutwadisi, mbuta wa Mabundu. Mukanda wubati mulomba mu kukala musadi wa bukheti wa Yesu Kidisitu. Mukanda wubati musongila buna bulungi mu kutsasa batu muna kimvuka, yi mana kafweti longa yi kulomba kwena kosu mutu (khaphu ya 4 yi kuna 6).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Pholu, thumwa wa Kidisitu Yesu mu kitumu kya Nzambi, Muhuludi wetu, yi Kidisitu Yesu, kivuvu kyetu.<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>Kwena Thimoti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mhb 16:1. </char></note> mwana wama wa kyedika mu lukwikilu: khenda, kheni yi ngemba bituki kwena Nzambi, Tata, yi kwena Kidisitu Yesu, Pfumu wetu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukebisa kikuma kya malongi ma luvunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Bwosu yíkuhekila kikesa ha yíkala ku Masetwani, ni wanangina ku Efesu ndangu wabakandisa batu babana babati longa malongi ma luvunu, <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>amana balandikilaku bingana-ngana keti ndonga ya butuka yakonda tsuka yina yisi nata tendu hana henina kisalu kya Nzambi, kina kibati salama mu lukwikilu. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Kisina kya kukebisa meni kuna, kyenina zola dina dyisi tuka ku mbundu ya kasemi, ku katsatsa ka kasemi yi lukwikilu lwakonda bukavungalosi. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Ndambu ya batu bahika bátota, amana báditotisa mu mameni ma phamba. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Bazodi bakituka balongi ba mitsiku kaasi bisiku bakisa mana bisi zonza, keti mambu mamana bisi tambwasa kya makulu.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Eeh, tuzayibwa ni mitsiku myenina mya bukheti, yuka ni twasadilamya mu mutindu wuna wulungini; <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Tuzayibwa phi ni mitsiku myásalamaku kikuma kya mukwa masonga, kaasi kikuma kya bandwandwa yi bakolami, batu bambi yi basumuki, basafu yi bazangi, bahondi ba batata yi bahondi ba bamama, baba bisi honda batu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>bita-mbongi, bayakala bana bisi dinimbisa yi bakwawu bayakala, batu baba bisi sala kikhita kya bahika, bakwa bukamvi, batu baba bisiku zenga ndefi ya masonga yi mambu mahika mama misiku fwanana yi malongi ma kyedika, <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>malongi mafwanana yi Musamu wa Bukheti wa khembu ya Nzambi wa kyesi wuna kápheka meni Pholu.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukala kabanzi ku mamboti ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Yimuvutwadi matondu lawu Kidisitu Yesu Pfumu wetu wuna wuphekini ngolu. Mukuma wámbona ni walunga yenina; yi hana katsidini mu kisalu, <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>meni yandu yikala musafula theti, kumunyokuna yi kumutukwana. Kaasi yandi wángyukila kheni, mudyambu yikalaku zaya mambu yikala sala, kukonda kwa lukwikilu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mhb 8:3; 9:4-5. </char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Amana khenda za Pfumu wetu zábasa, hakimosi yi lukwikilu yi zola dina dyenina mwena Kidisitu Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Ndinga yayi yenina ya kyedika, bafweti tambwasaya: Kidisitu Yesu kísa ha tsi yayi kikuma kya kuhulula basumuki; muna kati dya bawu, meni yenina wa mbi kuhyoka boosu. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Kaasi kikuma kya bwabuna, muna sipha dya mbundu wángyukila kheni, ndangu mwena meni, yenina wa mbi kuluta boosu, kuna thwala batu balanda mbandu ya meni, bakwikila mwena Kidisitu Yesu, ndangu babonga moya wa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Amana kwena Kyamvu wa mvula yi mvula, wuna wisiku fwa, wuna wisiku monika, Nzambi mosi, kabonga luzitu yi lukumu mvula yi mvula! Abwabuna!<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Kima yikutumi ngeyi mwana wama Thimoti, kituma meni kina kifwanani yi mbikutulu zina batekila samuna kikuma kya ngeyi; ndangu ha walándilaza, wanwana muzingu wa bukheti, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>wasimbidilaka lukwikilu lwaku yi katsatsa ka kasemi, kakana bakonda yukila batu bahika amana bamani totisa lukwikilu lwa bawu. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Mukati dya bawu thwenina yi Kimeni yi Lekizandi; babana yíbalambula<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haka, Pholu kabati zimbula ni kazodiku kuhana muswa kwena bawu boodi mu kukala hika mu kati kya Dibundu. </char></note> kedi kwa Satana ndangu bazaya ni ka mboti ku mu kulewulaka Nzambi.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Malongi matadidini lombilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Kima kya theti yiluhekidini kikesa, lwahanaka bizitu byenu, bilomba, lwabokwadilaka yi kuvutulaka matondu kikuma kya batu boosu, <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>kikuma kya bakyamvu yi kikuma kya boosu babana benina yi biyeka, ndangu twalenga kala yi luzingu lwa talala yi luzitu lwosu muna kuyekamina kwena Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Bwabuna bwenina bukheti amana kisibwa tambwasa Nzambi, Muhuludi wetu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>wuna wisi zola ni batu boosu bahuluka amana balenga tula mu kuzaya kyedika<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yez 18:23. </char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Mukuma Nzambi mosi kenina, amana phi mukhundikisi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kenina mukhundingisi ha kati dya betu yi Nzambi. Disongidila ni wuna wisi tukhundingisa. </char></note> mosi kenina hana kati dya Nzambi yi batu, mutu meni wuna kenina Kidisitu Yesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>yandi wádihana yandi-meni hanga thuka kikuma kya batu boosu: kyakina kimbangi kyáhanama muna tangwa dya kyawu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 20:28. </char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Kyakina bángyadikila meni, yikala mbambala, thumwa <note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2Th 1:11. </char></note> yi kiyeka kya kulonga, kwena babana bakondi kala Bayuta, lukwikilu yi kyedika. Nzonzibwa mu kyedika, phuniku.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna, nzodi ni bayakala boosu balombilaka kosu homa, bathutaka ku zilu moku ma bawu ma kasemi, konda kukalaka yi khabu keti tendu.<verse eid="1TI 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Kitesu kimosi phi, bakhetu bavwataka mutindu wa bukheti, wa luzitu, konda kudizatisa; badihandaku tsuki, keti bilunga bya wolu yi misanga keti miledi mihiti thalu<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Pi 3:3. </char></note>, <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>kaasi bavwata mihangu mya bukheti, bwosu buna bufwanini kwena bakhetu babana bisi monika ni bisi dihana kwena Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Bakhetu bafweti yukaka malongi mu talala yi kulemvuka kwosu. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Phaniku muswa kwena bakhetu mu kulonga, ho loni kubonga kiyeka ku thwala ya bayakala; bafweti kala talala. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Kikuma, Atamu watheti batekila sala, Evwa ku manima nana. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Amana ka Atamu ku wáhunakana, kaasi mukhetu, yandi wáhunakana, wákolama ku mutsiku wa Nzambi<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuyandika 2:7,21-22; 3:1-6. </char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Kaasi mukhetu kahúlukila muna bana babana kabúta, ho ni kakwamina muna lukwikilu, muna lungongu yi muna kuditomisa, ha kimosi yi kudikengaka.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Batwadisi ba Dibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Ndinga yayi yenina ya kyedika: Honi mutu kasola kukala mutwadisi, kisalu kya kitoku lawu kasodi. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Bulungi ni mutwadisi kakala konda kikalu, kafweti kala yakala wákwela mukhetu mosi, kisiku lutikisa kitesu, kadikengaka, kadizitisaka, kayambaka batu, kazaya kulonga, <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>kadihanaku mu kunwa malafu, kakalaku mukwa kingolu-ngolu; kaasi kakala mutu wa talala, mutu wa ngemba, kazolukaku mbongu; <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>katwadisaka bukheti nzu yandi amana bana bandi balemvukaka, mu luzitu lwosu. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Amana, honi mutu kisiku twadisa mboti batu benina muna nzu yandi, abweti kalenda twadisila Dibundu dya Nzambi? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Kakalaku mukidisitu wa pha; kondilo kaditsikisaka nana mu lulendu hanga ku tsuka kabonga nana ndola bwosu yina ya kiphidi-mutu. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Bulungini kakala yi kimbangi kya mboti kwena batu babana bakondi kala bakwikidi, ndangu bamulewulaku amana kabwa nana mu mutambu wa kiphidi-mutu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tit 1:6-9. </char></note>.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Basyelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Basyelu phi mutindu wumosi, bulungini bakalaka batu ba luzitu amana bakalaku batu ba ndinga zodi; balendaku dihanaka ku malafu ata kusosa miluta mya luvunu; <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>bafweti simbidila diswekamu dya lukwikilu muna katsatsa ka kasemi. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Babazyamina theti ku thwala ya kusala kisalu, yuka ni bakala batu bakonda kikalu. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Mutindu mosi phi, bakhetu bafweti kala bana bisi zitisa, konda mbonzi, bisiku hitikisa kitesu, batu bisi sila mbundu mu mambu moosu. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Basyelu bafweti kwela kaka mukhetu mosi amana batwadisaka bukheti bana ba bawu yi nzu ya bawu meni. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Mukuma basyelu babana básalakya bukheti kisalu bábazatisa yi kikumbwala kya lukwikilu kina kyenina mwena Kidisitu Yesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kitsweki kya mbuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Yikusonikini mukanda wawu yi kivuvu ni ka thama ku, yikwísa kutala. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Kaasi honi yizyeta, wazáya khi bikalulu wakadiki byawu mu nzu ya Nzambi, yina yenina Dibundu dya Nzambi wa moyu, yina yenina kunzi amana disi zyamisa mambu ma kyedika. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Eeh, bulungi lwazayabwa, diswekamu ditadidini mambu ma kinzambi dyenina dya mbuta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kidisitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">kisa monika mu lutu lwa kimutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">wádimonikisa mutu wa masonga muna nzila ya Kitembu Kyatoma<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lom 1:4. </char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">amana banzyo bámumona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Batu báyadingisa musamu wa Kidisitu ha kati dya babana bakondi kala Bayuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">bámukwikila kwena batu ba tsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">bámutombula mu khembu ya ku zilu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Malongi ma luvunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Kinga Kitembu kazonzibwa wengele: muna matangwa ma tsuka, batu bahika batótisalwa lukwikilu ndangu benda dihana ku bitembu byabina byisi hukumuna yi ku malongi ma bitembu bya mbi, <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>muna mutindu wa kavungalosi ka babana bisi longa mambu ma bukamvi, katsatsa ka bawu meni kenina ka zina ku kisengu kina kisi bema yi mbawu ya kabengi. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Batu babana bisi longa ni batu bakwelaku amana bisi bwisa ni badyaku bima byabi kásala Nzambi, kinga Nzambi kásadilabya ndangu, babana benina bakwikidi, bazayi phi kyedika, badyakabya mu kuvutulaka matondu. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Kinga bima byosu kásala Nzambi byenina bya bukheti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuy 1:31. </char></note>, amana kweku ata kima kimosi bafwani kulosa, yukani badyabya mu kuvutulaka matondu kwena Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>Kikuma byosu byenina byasambuka muna ndinga ya Nzambi yi muna lombilu.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musadi wa bukheti wa Yesu Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Ho wabalongaka baphangi bakidisitu malongi mamana, wakála musadi wa bukheti wa Kidisitu Yesu; wuna wisi longuka ndinga za lukwikilu yi malongi ma bukheti mamana wisi bonga kedi mboti-mboti. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Kaasi wutambwasakaku phandi za phamba, mameni ma bambuta ba bakhetu mana matadidiku lukwikilu. Dihanaka theti mu mambu ma kinzambi. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Mukuma tsaka za lutu zenina bukheti mu mambu makonda mupfunu, kaasi mambu ma kinzambi menina mupfunu mu mambu moosu: menina yi bilangi bya luzingu, kikuma kya luzingu lwa buthwena yi bilumbu bya ku thwala. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Ndinga yayi yenina ya kyedika amana yafwana mu kutambwasa kwena boosu: <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Kikuma, ho tubati diyangisa yi kunwanaka, mudyambu thwisi sya kivuvu kyetu mwena Nzambi wa moyu, wuna wenina Muhuludi wa batu boosu, batheti bakwikidi.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Tala mamana yikusendini mu kulongaka. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Ka mutu ku kalewula kingunza kyaku; kaasi ngeyi kala mbandu kwena bakwikidi, muna ndinga, muna khadidi, muna zola, muna lukwikilu yi muna kasemi. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Yikuna yikwisila, dihanaka mu kutangaka Masonuku ha mesu ma batu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kutanga kwaku kwa Masonuku ku mesu ma batu kwákala hanga kutanga kuna bakala sadila mu nzu ya kimvuka Bayuta. </char></note>, mu kuhanaka kikesa yi mu kulongaka. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Wulewulaku kabu dina wátambula mu nzila ya khenda dina wenina dyawu, dina wábonga muna nzila ya mbikutulu, tangwa bákusya moku kwena kibuka kya bambuta. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Simbidila mambu mama, dihana mu kisalu kyaki ndangu babana babati kuyuka bamóna ni kosu kima wubati sala, ku thwala kibati kwenda. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Dikengaka ngeyi meni yi muna malongi maku; sikila mwamuna. Mukuma ha wasadiki bwabuna, wadíhulula ngeyi-meni hakimosi yi babana bisi kuyuka.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mambu ma kusala kwena bakwetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Wukayaku mununu mu khabu, kaasi muheka kikesa hanga mbedi ni tata waku<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev 19:32. </char></note>. Basyamisa bangunza hanga baphangi, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>binunu bya bakhetu hanga bamama, bandumba hanga baphangi ba bakhetu, yi kusema kwosu.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Basadisa mboti-mboti bafwidi ba mukwandi. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Ho mufwidi kakala yi bana kondilo yi batekulu, bulungi mboti bayandika kusongila bifu bya kinzambi muna kati kya nzu ya bawu amana babasadisaka binunu bya bawu; mukuma bwabuna kisi tambwasa Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Mufwidi wa mukwandi, yandi wuna wásala yandi hika, wasya kivuvu kyandi mwena Nzambi; kisi kwamina phipha yi mwini muna bizitu byandi yi muna bisambu. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Kaasi mufwidi yandu wisi zingila mu tsambu, wafwa kedi mbatanana kisi monika ni moya kenina. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Tala mambu mama yikutumini mu kubasonikina, ndangu bakala konda kikalu. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Amana ho mutu wisiku sadisa biwutu byandi, theti-theti babana benina mu nzu yandi, wutunilwa lukwikilu, wa mbi lawu kuluta wuna wukondi kala mukwikidi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Mufwidi, ku thwala ya kumusonikisa mu ndonga ya bafwidi, bulungi kakala yi mvula kuluta makumi sambanu, kakala phi mukhetu bákwela kwena yakala mosi; <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>kakala phi yi kimbangi kya mihangu mya bukheti: mutindu wuna kakala tsatsila mboti-mboti bana bandi, kakala yambila batu ku nzu, kakala sukwala bitambi bya batu ba Nzambi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 7:44. </char></note>, kikuma kya bwabuna kakala yakidila batu babana bákala mu phasi yi mutindu wuna kakala dihanina mu kosu mihangu mya bukheti.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Kikuma kya bafwidi baba beku kedi bambuta, lubasonikisaku ku mukanda; kikuma ha bayuka hika tsambu ya kukwela, badihanaku kwena Kidisitu <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>amana dyakala ni babafundisa kikuma kya buna babebisini mutindu wa theti wa kudihana kwena Kidisitu. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Dikwawu phi, bwosu benina bamolu, basanda benda kangala mu nzu za lawu, bwosu batsúkinaku lwesi mu kukala bamolu, bazonziki lawu amana bakotiki kosu dyambu, bazonzaka ata mambu mana mafwaniku mu kuzonza. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna, yizóla ni bangunza ba bafwidi bakwelaka, babuta bana, bakala batwadisi ba bukheti muna nzu za bawu; ndangu bamuheka nana nzila mbeni ya kwenda tuhuna musamu. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Mukuma kwenina yi bafwidi bahika baba batoti kedi mu kulanda Satana. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Ho mukwikidi mosi wa mukhetu kakala yi biwutu byandi bya bafwidi, kabasadisaka amana Dibundu dibongaku kiyeka, ndangu Dibundu kalenga sadisa lwesi baba benina kyedika bafwidi.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Kwena bambuta ba Dibundu bana bisi twadisa bukheti, bulungi babahekaka luzitu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masonuku mahika mazimbudi ni lufutu. </char></note> mbala zodi, kuluta lawu babana bisi dihana lawu mu Ndinga ya Nzambi yi mu kulonga. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Kikuma Masonuku mazonzini: «Wamukasaku munwa ngombi tangwa kabati nika ngenza», amana: «Bulungi musadi kabonga lufutu lwandi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Klg 25:4 yi 1Ko 9:9; Mth 10:10; Luk 10:7. </char></note>.» <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Wutambwasaku mutu mosi kisa funda mbuta, akolu ni bakala bambangi bodi kondilo batatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Batu baba basadi masumu, bakaya ku thwala ya batu boosu, ndangu batu bahika bayukaka bweya.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Yikusikidikisi ku thwala ya Nzambi, ku thwala ya Kidisitu Yesu yi ku thwala ya banzyo babana básolama, mu kusadila mikuku myami buna bufwani konda kusola mbunzu za batu. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Wutsutsaku mu kusya mutu moku. Kalaku mu kithwadi yi mutu wuna wusadi masumu; kala wa kasemi ngeyi-meni.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Wunwakaku lwesi mamba; sadilaka phi koma ka vinu, kikuma kya mukati yi buna wisi kuyangisa.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Masumu ma batu bahika mazayakani wengele amana misi tekidila mu pfundusu; kwena batu bahika misi landa ku manima. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Mutindu mosi, mihangu mya bukheti myisi zayakana: ata myami mya mbi, mina tubatiku mona buthwena, myalendaku swamana.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Batu baba benina mu kizitu kya kihika bulungi mboti babazitisaka bapfumu ba bawu, ndangu balewasaku zina dya Nzambi yi malongi mama balonga. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Ho bawu bakala yi bapfumu ba bakwikidi, bafwaniku ni babakondaka luzitu mu mvunga ni benina baphangi ba bawu. Kaasi bafweti basadila kuluta, kikuma benina bakwikidi yi biwutu bya bawu bya kutya bisi sadila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Malongi ma mbi yi bimvwama bya kyedika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Tala mambu mama wufweti longa yi kutuma. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Ho mutu kamwangaka malongi mahika konda kulandaka malongi ma kyedika ma Pfumu wetu Yesu Kidisitu yi malongi mana ma kinzambi, <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>kenina mutu wabasa yi lulendu, kazayiku kima; kimbefu kyandi kya kunanama yi ngyuma zitadidi mihowu. Kwakuna kwisi butuka kiphala, matendu, kutukwana, kubongilaka bakwenu mabanza ma mbi, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>kutendana kwa konda tsuka kwa batu babana benina yi mayedi mazangana, makonda kyedika, bawu bisi dila mu mvunga za kinzambi.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Kinga, kinzambi kyenina yi muluta wa lawu, ho wasangwalaka mu kina wenina kyawu. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Kikuma, thwisaku yi kima mu tsi, amana twalendaku nata phi keti kima. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Muna bwabuna, ho twakala yi madya yi miledi, byabina byatúfwana kwetu. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Kaasi batu babana bisi sanda bakituka bamvwama bisi bwa mu kimeka, mu mutambu yi mu tsatu za lawu za buzoba yi za phasi, zisi banata mu kuzangana yi mu lufwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Mukuma zola dya mbongu dyenina kisina kya mbi zoosu, amana batu bahika bádihana mwamuna, báditotisa kyana yi lukwikilu amana bádinyokuna bawu meni.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongisila za tsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Kaasi ngeyi, mutu wa Nzambi, hangakaku mambu ma buna. Sandaka masonga, kinzambi, lukwikilu, zola, sipha dya mbundu, lembami. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Nwana muzingu wa bukheti wa lukwikilu, simbidila moya wa mvula yi mvula, wuna bákutedila yi kikuma kya bwabuna wátambwasila dyambu ku thwala ya bambangi balawu. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Yikuhekini muswa ku thwala ya Nzambi, wuna wisi hulula moya kwena bihangwa byosu yi ku thwala ya Yesu Kidisitu, wuna wáhana kimbangi mu kutambwasa dyambu ku thwala ya Phosi Philatu, <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>mu kusimbidilaka mikuku konda kifu, konda kikalu, tii yikuna kakwisa monikina Pfumu wetu Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Kumonika kwakuna kwa Pfumu wetu kwasálama muna tangwa dina kásila Nzambi wa kyesi yi Pfumu lwesi, Kyamvu wa bakyamvu yi Pfumu wa bapfumu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Klg 10:17; Mkg 136:3. </char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Yandi wuna lwesi wisiku fwa, mwena yandi mwenina yi mwini wumosi bisiku tala; keti mutu khaniku kamonawa amana kalendawoku mona; kwena Yandi, lukumu yi ngolu zilutini za mvula yi mvula! Abwabuna!<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Senda kwena baba benina yi bimvwama mu tsi yayi ni bakalaku yi lulendu amana basyaku kivuvu mu bimvwama byakonda kwatakani<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:20. </char></note>; kaasi kivuvu kya bawu kyakala mwena Nzambi wuna wisi tuheka byosu bya lawu, ndangu byatuhekaka kyesi. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Basenda ni basalaka mambu mamboti, bakalaka bamvwama muna mihangu mya bukheti, bakalaka yi kyesi kya kukabila batu bahika. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Balumbikaka bwabuna kimvwama kya bukheti yi kya ngolu kikuma kya tangwa dina dyakwísa<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 6.20. </char></note>, ndangu babonga moya wa kyedika.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Muzitu Thimoti, batika bukheti kima kina bákuheka. Wunanamakaku mu phandi za phamba yi za masafu yi phaka za luvunu, zina bisi mona hangambedi ni mazaya. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Kikuma, batu bahika, bwosu bázola mu kulanda mazaya meni mamana, bátotisa nzila ya bawu ya lukwikilu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Khenda zakala kwena benu!<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
